 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-fdn-m5",
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# FDN Dreadwing Scavenger: \"Flying. Whenever this creature enters or attacks, draw a card, then\n# discard a card. Threshold — This creature gets +1/+1 and has deathtouch as long as there are seven\n# or more cards in your graveyard.\"\n# [0], [1]: MAPPER_GUIDE R_TWOEVENTS, \"enters or attacks\": the compiler's \"When this creature enters\"\n# event, then Library Larcenist's DeclareAttackersEvent(IS_SOURCE), one byte-equal effect: M21\n# Obsessive Stitcher's verified loot (\"Draw a card, then discard a card\").\n# [2]: M21 Thieves' Guild Enforcer's verified self static (+N/+N and deathtouch, the \"as long as\" in\n# StaticAbility.condition, D22), its ZONE_COUNT_GE read over your own graveyard at seven.\nloot = Seq(\n    steps=(\n        A(Verb.DRAW, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n        A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n            'cards': Selector(\n                count=QConst(value=1),\n                mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                filter=FAnd(children=()),\n                zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.HAND, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),),\n            ),\n            'controller': ControllerRef.YOU,\n            'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.GRAVEYARD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            'from': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.HAND, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        }),\n    ),\n)\n# R_TWOEVENTS\nenters = TriggeredAbility(event=ZoneChangeEvent(\n    from_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.ANY, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),\n    to_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n    subject=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)), condition=None, effect=loot)\nattacks = TriggeredAbility(event=DeclareAttackersEvent(filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n                           condition=None, effect=loot)\nthis_creature = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nthreshold = StaticAbility(\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=1)),\n                'target': this_creature,\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=1)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.DEATHTOUCH),\n                'target': this_creature,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n    condition=FAtom(\n        pred=FAtomPred.ZONE_COUNT_GE,\n        count=QConst(value=7),\n        who=ControllerRef.YOU,\n        inner_filter=FAnd(children=()),\n        zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.GRAVEYARD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [enters, attacks, threshold, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Flying",
    "ir": "keywords[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, draw a card, then discard a card.",
    "ir": "abilities[0] (enters), abilities[1] (attacks): one effect"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Threshold — This creature gets +1/+1 and has deathtouch as long as there are seven or more cards in your graveyard.",
    "ir": "abilities[2]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "MAPPER_GUIDE R_TWOEVENTS 'enters or attacks': the enters trigger and DeclareAttackersEvent(IS_SOURCE), byte-equal effects, Obsessive Stitcher's verified loot; Threshold as Thieves' Guild Enforcer's verified self static (+1/+1 and deathtouch, StaticAbility.condition ZONE_COUNT_GE 7 over your graveyard). packs in tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/: dreadwing_scavenger_threshold_seven_cards, dreadwing_scavenger_six_cards_no_threshold."
 },
